ordinary bleeding;
poison;
disease;
internal injury;
unusual blood loss;
foreign bloodline contamination;
ordinary exhaustion;
one obvious bodily curse or transformation. Physician’s Pulse provides diagnosis, not automatic removal.

tianxia.talent.blood.scarlet_mist_form:
