Transform partially into blood mist.
Gain:
Fly Speed 30 feet and Hover;
Resistance to nonmagical Bludgeoning, Piercing, and Slashing damage;
ability to move through occupied spaces as difficult terrain;
ability to pass through openings as narrow as 1 inch;
Advantage on checks made to escape Grappled or Restrained;
ability to apply Blood Thread automatically to one creature whose space you move through, once per turn. You cannot pass through sealed barriers or solid objects.

tianxia.talent.chains.chain_breaker_s_le:
### Chain-Breaker’s Lesson
Tags: AnchorPassive
You learn how chains fail, and therefore how to escape them.
You gain Advantage on checks and saving throws made to escape:
Grappled;
Restrained;
Bound;
physical chains;
ropes;
nets;
manacles;
shackles;
similar bodily restraints.
Once per short rest, when you fail one of these checks or saves, you may reroll it. You must use the new result.

tianxia.talent.chains.chain_bridge:
