Tags: Project, Prison, Restricted
Action Type: Multi-Mode
Split Review Decision: procedure_only_not_combat_action
Recommended Factory Realization: procedures=THIRTY_DAY_PROJECT
Timing Detail: Ritual / Strategic Project
