You create a permanent prison, containment vault, sect dungeon, sealed gate network, or oath-bound prison compound.
Choose three benefits:
ordinary teleportation into or out of protected rooms fails;
Chains talents cost 1 fewer CP once per turn nearby, minimum 1;
prisoners trigger warning chains if they move beyond assigned areas;
gates resist forced entry;
captured spirits may be held more safely;
