double the dimensions of one Blast Shape used for this release;
deal two additional Destruction Dice to objects, structures, barriers, and formation anchors;
force one creature that failed its saving throw against the release to lose Reactions and have its Speed halved until the start of your next turn.
You can use Heaven-Cracking Release once per short rest.

tianxia.talent.disease.court_of_the_craw:
